# kcp.suite — siblings that reach each other over kcp alone.
#
# kcp-only-relink drops tcp between node1 and node2 and restarts node2, and
# nothing puts tcp back, so only its descendants follow it in its world. It
# has a suite of its own because each VM suite is one world's worth of VM time.
# kcp-restart-stale-link continues that world: node2 is killed and starts
# again, and node1 drops the stale kcp link (ticket akchpFNjbO, S5).
bootstrap-user-software-key
adopt-node
kcp-only-relink
kcp-restart-stale-link
